<ul>
<li>Dictate in 28 European languages: pick yours under Settings &gt; Transcription &gt; Dictation language. English stays the default and works exactly as before.</li>
<li>Refine now cleans up dictation in Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, and Polish - always in the language you spoke, never translating.</li>
<li>For languages Refine does not support yet, cleanup pauses: your words are inserted exactly as transcribed, the Refine settings explain why they are greyed out, and your configuration is restored when you switch back.</li>
<li>New end-to-end coverage dictating real audio in all eight supported cleanup languages against the production pipeline.</li>
</ul>
